{
  "name": "Stop all outreach to a company when its HubSpot deal is won",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stop all outreach to a company when its HubSpot deal is won\n\n### How it works\nNew customers should never get a cold email. The HubSpot Trigger fires when a deal stage changes. If the new stage is Closed won, the workflow reads the deal's contacts, gets their emails and adds each address to the Argorant blocklist. A blocked address leaves every running campaign at once and is never added again. With block_domain on, the whole company domain is blocked too, so colleagues are skipped as well.\n\nNo credits are used.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the community node **n8n-nodes-argorant** (tested with 0.3.0 on n8n 2.46.6): Settings > Community nodes > Install. Guide: https://github.com/argorant/n8n-nodes-argorant\n2. Add an **Argorant API** credential with a key from Argorant (Settings, API keys).\n3. Add a HubSpot credential to **Deal stage changed**, **Get deal contacts** and **Get contact email**.\n4. In **Settings**, check won_stage (closedwon in the default pipeline) and block_domain.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\n### Customization\nUse a different stage, or post a note to your team chat after the block.",
        "height": 592,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "dc5bff0f-6d38-40a7-89af-262b9ccefda9",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
